<title>USA: Dickson to open Kenneth Cole stores.</title>
<headline>Dickson to open Kenneth Cole stores.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenneth Cole Productions Inc said Thursday that it had entered into an exclusive license agreement with a unit of Dickson Concepts Ltd to distribute its products in parts of Asia.</p>
<p>The company said Dickson Licensing Ltd, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Dickson, planned to start a network of Kenneth Cole retail stores in Hong Kong, Singapore and Taiwan within the next year and a half.</p>
<p>&quot;The second phase of the agreement provides for launches in China, Indonesia, and Malaysia, resulting in Kenneth Cole retail stores and products in all six countries by the end of 1999,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
